multiplayer modes, it transforms your room into a dynamic battlefield!\n\nFeatures:\n- Future of toys - tanks battle in your room!\n- True room-scale fun gameplay - adapts to any room size\n- 8 game modes to play alone or with friends\n- Remote and co-located multiplayer - up to 8 players in the same room \n- Rich Single-Player campaign\n- Built-in level editor\n- Unlockable tank parts and skins\n\nTurn your own living room into a tank battle!\n(and please remember this is a Beta version)", "short_description": "Turn your own living room into a tank battle! Holotanks is a action packed truly room-scale co-located Mixed Reality toy tanks game featuring SP and MP modes. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://beatshapers.com/holotanks_privacy.txt", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Fortell Games Inc", "support_website_url": "https://www.fortell.games/", "website_url": "https://www.fortell.games/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER", "MULTI_USER", "CO_OP"], "id": "7619404678188533"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57569457_1005703390526206_4811816033278719630_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=egiSq6uZPL0Q7kNvwGsPazn&_nc_oc=AdqpgnnUMS4_ov5XaAZrkYwYPZP0ZjkddVVEWfBGgRqrkMqctU-RtVMk7pPCp9BM8UM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scon